		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Enormous wingless dragon with glacier-white scales.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +8 (2d10) and 2 claws +8 (2d8) or 1 ice breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim, burrow), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Curse</strong>. When slain, death curses the slayer. WIS 15+ or cursed to take double damage from cold.</p><p></p><p><strong>Frostblood</strong>. Cold immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ice Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from linnorm. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage and frozen for 1 round.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
